msgid "Uh, it's because my throat's been acting up..."
msgstr "Uh, es porque mi garganta ha estado molestando..."

msgctxt "496_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You never told me you were such a good singer!\\r\n"
"Wanna try to make it to the big time together!?"
msgstr "¡Nunca me dijiste que eras tan buen cantante!\\r\n"
"¿¡Quieres que intentemos llegar a lo más alto juntos!?"

